        <item>
            <title><![CDATA[Launch]]></title>
            <link>https://swissdatasciencecenter.github.io/best-practice-documentation/blog/2025/08/19/announce</link>
            <guid>https://swissdatasciencecenter.github.io/best-practice-documentation/blog/2025/08/19/announce</guid>
            <pubDate>Tue, 19 Aug 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[Dear all,]]></description>
            <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Dear all,</p>
<p>We are excited to announce the <strong>SDSC-wide best-practices &amp; guidelines
documentation</strong> 🎉.</p>
<p>Thanks to all the work from the <strong>Best-Practice Ambassador Team</strong>, we're
launching the docs and we welcome any contributor to help us improve it and
expand it 👏🏽.</p>
<p>This documentation is primarily intended for <strong>research software developers and
data scientists</strong>.</p>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="goals">Goals<a href="https://swissdatasciencecenter.github.io/best-practice-documentation/blog/2025/08/19/announce#goals" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Goals" title="Direct link to Goals">​</a></h2>
<p>The goal of this documentation is to streamline state-of-the-art best-practices
&amp; guidelines for everybody
<a href="https://swissdatasciencecenter.github.io/best-practice-documentation/docs/chapters/how-to-cite" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">to reuse and cite</a>.
Every page
<a href="https://swissdatasciencecenter.github.io/best-practice-documentation/docs/tags" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><strong>is tagged</strong></a>
to make the documentation more searchable.</p>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="links">Links<a href="https://swissdatasciencecenter.github.io/best-practice-documentation/blog/2025/08/19/announce#links" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Links" title="Direct link to Links">​</a></h2>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://pages.datascience.ch/sdsc-best-practices/documentation/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Internal Documentation</a></li>
<li><a href="https://swissdatasciencecenter.github.io/best-practice-documentation/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Public Documentation</a></li>
<li><a href="https://pages.datascience.ch/sdsc-best-practices/documentation/docs/category/all-meetings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">BPA Meeting Notes</a></li>
<li><a href="https://gitlab.datascience.ch/sdsc-best-practices/documentation" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Repository</a></li>
</ul>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="call-to-action">Call to Action<a href="https://swissdatasciencecenter.github.io/best-practice-documentation/blog/2025/08/19/announce#call-to-action" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Call to Action" title="Direct link to Call to Action">​</a></h2>
<p>Now we need you 🫵🏼 - as many pages are still under construction and would
benefit from your input 🚧. If you wanna feel like a hero and you'd like to
contribute, please start by reading the
<a href="https://pages.datascience.ch/sdsc-best-practices/documentation/docs/contribute/intro" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">contribution guide</a>.
We appreciate any input, opinion or suggestion 💘. It is also advisable to
announce your contributions <a href="https://swissdatasciencecenter.github.io/best-practice-documentation/blog/2025/08/19/announce#join-the-community">first here</a> to reduce
double-work and friction. Note that <strong>your authorship</strong> will become more
prominently visible to the public once we
<a href="https://gitlab.datascience.ch/sdsc-best-practices/documentation/-/issues/9" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">integrated this issue</a>.</p>
<p>Topics may become outdated over time. As the author of a topic, please review
your contributions periodically and update them as needed. We plan to introduce
automated reminders for this in the future.</p>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="join-the-community">Join the Community<a href="https://swissdatasciencecenter.github.io/best-practice-documentation/blog/2025/08/19/announce#join-the-community" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Join the Community" title="Direct link to Join the Community">​</a></h2>
<p>For support with new topics, integration, or any other questions, join the
discussion in the
<a href="https://swiss-data-science.slack.com/archives/C09ATVARBSP" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">best-practice documentation Slack channel</a>.</p>
<p>BR Best-Practice Ambassadors</p>]]></content:encoded>
        </item>
